relaxed\">Add page numbers to your PDF with custom position and styling.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300\"><span>Use <!-- -->Page Numbers</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\"group relative antigravity-card-3d p-6 rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between\" href=\"/pdf-tools/protect\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-500/15 border border-blue-500/35 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all shadow-inner\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg></div></div><div><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-lg text-white group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5\">Protect PDF</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 mt-2 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed\">Encrypt your PDF files with user and owner passwords.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300\"><span>Use <!-- -->Protect PDF</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\"group relative antigravity-card-3d p-6 rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between\" href=\"/pdf-tools/unlock\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-500/15 border border-blue-500/35 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all shadow-inner\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock-open w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 9.9-1\"></path></svg></div></div><div><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-lg text-white group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5\">Unlock PDF</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 mt-2 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed\">Remove password protection and security restrictions from your PDF.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300\"><span>Use <!-- -->Unlock PDF</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\"group relative antigravity-card-3d p-6 rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between\" href=\"/pdf-tools/edit\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-500/15 border border-blue-500/35 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all shadow-inner\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></div></div><div><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-lg text-white group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5\">Edit PDF</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 mt-2 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed\">Add text annotations, shapes, drawings, and images directly onto PDF pages.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300\"><span>Use <!-- -->Edit PDF</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\"group relative antigravity-card-3d p-6 rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between\" href=\"/pdf-tools/redact\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-500/15 border border-blue-500/35 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all shadow-inner\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye-off w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.733 5.076a10.744 10.744 0 0 1 11.205 6.575 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.747 10.747 0 0 1-1.444 2.49\"></path><path d=\"M14.084 14.158a3 3 0 0 1-4.242-4.242\"></path><path d=\"M17.479 17.499a10.75 10.75 0 0 1-15.417-5.151 1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 4.446-5.143\"></path><path d=\"m2 2 20 20\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-500/15 border border-emerald-500/35 text-emerald-400 shadow-sm\">Privacy</span></div><div><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-lg text-white group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5\">Redact PDF</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 mt-2 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed\">Permanently black out sensitive numbers, signatures, and private text.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300\"><span>Use <!-- -->Redact PDF</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\"group relative antigravity-card-3d p-6 rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between\" href=\"/pdf-tools/compare\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-500/15 border border-blue-500/35 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all shadow-inner\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-columns2 lucide-columns-2 w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 3v18\"></path></svg></div></div><div><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-lg text-white group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5\">Compare PDF</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 mt-2 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed\">Compare two PDF documents side-by-side to highlight visual changes.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300\"><span>Use <!-- -->Compare PDF</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\"group relative antigravity-card-3d p-6 rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between\" href=\"/pdf-tools/scan\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-500/15 border border-blue-500/35 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all shadow-inner\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-camera w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.997 4a2 2 0 0 1 1.76 1.05l.486.9A2 2 0 0 0 18.003 7H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V9a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h1.997a2 2 0 0 0 1.759-1.048l.489-.904A2 2 0 0 1 10.004 4z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div></div><div><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-lg text-white group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5\">Scan to PDF</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 mt-2 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed\">Capture documents from your camera/webcam and convert directly to PDF.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300\"><span>Use <!-- -->Scan to PDF</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\"group relative antigravity-card-3d p-6 rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between\" href=\"/pdf-tools/pdf-to-text\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-500/15 border border-blue-500/35 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all shadow-inner\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-code w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M10 12.5 8 15l2 2.5\"></path><path d=\"m14 12.5 2 2.5-2 2.5\"></path></svg></div></div><div><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-lg text-white group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5\">PDF to Text</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 mt-2 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed\">Extract readable text and copyable contents from PDF pages.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300\"><span>Use <!-- -->PDF to Text</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></a><a class=\"group relative antigravity-card-3d p-6 rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between\" href=\"/pdf-tools/html-to-pdf\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-500/15 border border-blue-500/35 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all shadow-inner\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 18 6-6-6-6\"></path><path d=\"m8 6-6 6 6 6\"></path></svg></div></div><div><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-lg text-white group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5\">HTML / Text to PDF</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 mt-2 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed\">Convert styled HTML text or markdown documents into formatted PDFs.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-blue-400 group-hover:text-blue-300\"><span>Use <!-- -->HTML / Text to PDF</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></div><section class=\"mt-16 border-t border-white/10 pt-12 space-y-12 max-w-5xl mx-auto\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebApplication\",\"name\":\"FitMyForm - Student Document Resizer & Formatter\",\"url\":\"https://fitmyform.com\",\"applicationCategory\":\"UtilitiesApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"All\",\"browserRequirements\":\"Requires JavaScript. Requires HTML5 Canvas.\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\"},\"description\":\"Most online PDF conversion tools upload your confidential documents (such as Aadhaar card, PAN card, bank statements, certificates, and signatures) to external cloud servers. FitMyForm uses HTML5 APIs, JavaScript WebAssembly, and pdf-lib to process all PDF modifications directly in your device RAM without transmitting byte data over the internet.\"}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Resize Document for Online Application Forms using FitMyForm\",\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Upload Document\",\"text\":\"Select or drop your photo, signature, thumb impression, or certificate.\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Configure Form Requirements\",\"text\":\"Select exam preset (SSC, UPSC, Banking, CTET) or enter target width, height, and KB limit.\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Process & Download\",\"text\":\"The client-side engine automatically resizes, crops, and compresses your file for instant download.\"}]}</script><div class=\"space-y-3 text-center sm:text-left\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight\">Why Choose FitMyForm Client-Side PDF Tools?</h2><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\">Most online PDF conversion tools upload your confidential documents (such as Aadhaar card, PAN card, bank statements, certificates, and signatures) to external cloud servers. FitMyForm uses HTML5 APIs, JavaScript WebAssembly, and pdf-lib to process all PDF modifications directly in your device RAM without transmitting byte data over the internet.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><div class=\"antigravity-card-3d p-6 rounded-3xl space-y-3\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500/15 border border-emerald-500/35 flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-sm text-white\">100% Client-Side Privacy</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\">No document is ever uploaded to any cloud server. Your sensitive photos, Aadhaar cards, and signatures remain safely inside your browser memory.</p></div><div class=\"antigravity-card-3d p-6 rounded-3xl space-y-3\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-500/15 border border-indigo-500/35 flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap w-5 h-5 text-indigo-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15.914 4a1.5 1.5 0 00-2.474-1.561l-9 9A1.5 1.5 0 005.5 14h4.002a.5.5 0 01.471.666L8.086 20a1.5 1.5 0 002.475 1.56l9-9A1.5 1.5 0 0018.5 10h-3.997a.5.5 0 01-.472-.667z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-sm text-white\">High-Precision Compression</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\">Iterative binary search quality adjustments guarantee your file fits exactly inside the required KB window (e.g. 20–50 KB) without blurriness.</p></div><div class=\"antigravity-card-3d p-6 rounded-3xl space-y-3\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-500/15 border border-cyan-500/35 flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-sm text-white\">Official Exam Specs</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\">Pre-loaded requirements database for SSC, UPSC, IBPS, RRB Railway, NTA NEET/JEE, UPTET, CTET, and University Admissions.</p></div></div><div class=\"glass-panel-antigravity rounded-3xl p-6 space-y-4 shadow-2xl\"><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-base text-white flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>Standard Indian Exam Document Requirements Cheat Sheet</span></h3><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full text-xs text-left text-slate-300\"><thead class=\"bg-[#080b11]/80 text-slate-300 uppercase font-mono text-[10px] border-b border-white/10\"><tr><th class=\"p-3.5\">Exam Portal</th><th class=\"p-3.5\">Doc Type</th><th class=\"p-3.5\">Dimensions</th><th class=\"p-3.5\">Target KB Limits</th><th class=\"p-3.5\">Output Format</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-white/10 font-mono\"><tr><td class=\"p-3.5 font-extrabold text-white\">SSC (CGL/CHSL)</td><td class=\"p-3.5\">Passport Photo</td><td class=\"p-3.5 text-indigo-300 font-bold\">200 × 230 px</td><td class=\"p-3.5 text-emerald-400 font-bold\">20 – 50 KB</td><td class=\"p-3.5\">JPG / JPEG</td></tr><tr><td class=\"p-3.5 font-extrabold text-white\">SSC (CGL/CHSL)</td><td class=\"p-3.5\">Signature</td><td class=\"p-3.5 text-indigo-300 font-bold\">140 × 60 px</td><td class=\"p-3.5 text-emerald-400 font-bold\">10 – 20 KB</td><td class=\"p-3.5\">JPG / JPEG</td></tr><tr><td class=\"p-3.5 font-extrabold text-white\">UPSC Civil Services</td><td class=\"p-3.5\">Photo &amp; Sig</td><td class=\"p-3.5 text-indigo-300 font-bold\">350 × 350 px (Min)</td><td class=\"p-3.5 text-emerald-400 font-bold\">20 – 300 KB</td><td class=\"p-3.5\">JPG / JPEG</td></tr><tr><td class=\"p-3.5 font-extrabold text-white\">IBPS Banking</td><td class=\"p-3.5\">Left Thumb</td><td class=\"p-3.5 text-indigo-300 font-bold\">240 × 240 px</td><td class=\"p-3.5 text-emerald-400 font-bold\">20 – 50 KB</td><td class=\"p-3.5\">JPG / JPEG</td></tr><tr><td class=\"p-3.5 font-extrabold text-white\">Railway RRB</td><td class=\"p-3.5\">Passport Photo</td><td class=\"p-3.5 text-indigo-300 font-bold\">350 × 450 px</td><td class=\"p-3.5 text-emerald-400 font-bold\">20 – 50 KB</td><td class=\"p-3.5\">JPG / JPEG</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"space-y-5\"><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-xl text-white flex items-center gap-2.5 tracking-tight\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/20 border border-indigo-500/40 flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-question-mark w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg></div><span>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</span></h3><div class=\"space-y-3.5\"><div class=\"glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 space-y-2 shadow-lg\"><h4 class=\"font-extrabold text-white text-sm flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Are my PDF files uploaded to any server?</span></h4><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 pl-6 leading-relaxed\">No. FitMyForm is a 100% browser-side application. Your files never leave your computer or phone.</p></div><div class=\"glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 space-y-2 shadow-lg\"><h4 class=\"font-extrabold text-white text-sm flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Can I merge multiple PDFs into one document?</span></h4><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 pl-6 leading-relaxed\">Yes! Use our Merge PDF tool to drop multiple PDF files, reorder pages as needed, and combine them into a single file.</p></div><div class=\"glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 space-y-2 shadow-lg\"><h4 class=\"font-extrabold text-white text-sm flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>How do I compress a PDF for government exam forms?</span></h4><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 pl-6 leading-relaxed\">Click on the Compress PDF tool, select your desired file size or compression level, and FitMyForm will optimize object streams and embedded images.</p></div><div class=\"glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 space-y-2 shadow-lg\"><h4 class=\"font-extrabold text-white text-sm flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Is it free to sign or watermark PDFs?</span></h4><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 pl-6 leading-relaxed\">Yes, 100% free with unlimited usage and zero hidden subscription fees.</p></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"w-full bg-[#05070c] border-t border-white/10 text-slate-400 py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 mt-16 relative\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-12\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-8\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-2 space-y-4\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 group\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-600/20 border border-indigo-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-inner\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-check w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"m9 15 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"font-extrabold text-xl tracking-tight text-white font-sans\">FitMy<span class=\"gradient-text font-black\">Form</span></span></a><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-w-sm\">The fastest 100% free client-side web application for image modification, e-signing, and student document formatting. Compress, resize, e-sign, crop, convert, watermark, and upscale photos &amp; PDFs securely in your web browser.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-emerald-400 font-bold bg-emerald-500